          "overview": "## Send4 MCP Server\n\nThe official Send4 MCP server connects an AI assistant to a Send4 workspace: AI SMS and email for sales and support teams. The assistant reads and changes the workspace's flows, campaigns, conversations, leads and meetings as the signed-in person, with that person's role and permissions.\n\nTypical workflows: ask why a lead's conversation went quiet and read the thread; duplicate a live flow, change the copy, rehearse it and switch it on; build and launch an SMS or email campaign; book or move a meeting; report performance, drop-off and campaign results. Launching a campaign, switching a flow on or texting a typed number is a read-only `preview_*` tool that returns a summary for the person to confirm, then the write.\n\nSign-in is OAuth 2.1 with dynamic client registration and PKCE. A workspace admin switches AI assistants on, and each kind of change has its own switch, off by default. Changes are recorded in the workspace audit log. Requires a Send4 workspace on a plan or a started trial.",
